        <skos:altLabel>Womb structure</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A hollow, thick-walled, muscular organ located within the pelvic cavity of a woman. Within the uterus the fertilized egg implants and the fetus develops during pregnancy. [NCIT]</skos:definition>
