        <skos:altLabel>Neoplasm of breast (disorder)</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Tumor of breast</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Tumour of breast</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>A benign or malignant neoplasm of the breast parenchyma. It can originate from the ducts, lobules or the breast adipose tissue. Breast neoplasms are much more common in females than males. [NCIT]</skos:definition>
