        <skos:definition>A grade 3 or grade 4 glioma arising from the central nervous system. This category includes glioblastoma, anaplastic astrocytoma, anaplastic ependymoma, anaplastic oligodendroglioma, and anaplastic oligoastrocytoma. [NCIT]</skos:definition>
        <skos:exactMatch>NCIT:C4822</skos:exactMatch>
