        <skos:altLabel>CTDIvol</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>Computed Tomography Dose Index</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel>volume CT dose index</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>The International Electrotechnical Commission preferred expression of radiation dose in computed tomography (CT) dosimetry. It is calculated by averaging the radiation dose delivered over x,y and z directions and expressed in the SI unit of Gray (Gy). [NCIT]</skos:definition>
        <skos:exactMatch>RadLex:RID12357</skos:exactMatch>
